or: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><a href="http://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F904560" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2024584737/Module-Header-Brand-Extended-generic.jpg" title="Qantas" alt="Qantas" width="680" height="70" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F8FB780"></font></a></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F9047C0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F903AB0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table><table id="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F903D10" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F903F70"><td valign="top" align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F903390" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: left; height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F9035F0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F900910"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F900B70" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F900DD0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F901030" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F901290"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F902570" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><p data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F9027D0" style="line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 2px; margin-left: 0px;"></p></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F901E50"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F9020B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We recognise that being able to keep track of your travel spend is essential, but at this stage, we don't have a solution available to your business for bespoke reporting.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F9014F0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F901750" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F9001F0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F900450" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We are continuously looking for opportunities to improve our program and deliver better value to your business, and we thank you for your feedback - we'll pass this onto our product development team.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47FD10"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47FF70" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F4801D0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F484A00" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">You can continue to request tax invoices for specific flights via&nbsp;<a data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E1E4D0" href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/manage-booking/tax-invoice.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">qantas.com</a>.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F480A20"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F8FC0E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F2BF0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F2D20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Kind regards,</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F2E50"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F50B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F51E0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F5310" style="font-family: Arial, Ciutadella; font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F5560">{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F484C60">{!User.Title}<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F902900"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F9019B0">Qantas Inside Sales, Business &amp; Government Sales<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F5690">Qantas Airways Limited<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F57A0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F58B0">A Wing, Level 4, 10 Bourke Road, Mascot NSW 2020<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F59C0">P. 13 10 85 Ext 36<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F5AD0">E.&nbsp;<a href="mailto:corpsalesaus@qantas.com.au" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F5BE0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">corpsalesaus@qantas.com.au</a><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F5D10"></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F5E20"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F5F50" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F6080"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F62E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F6540" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" height="50" width="307" title="Qantas" alt="Qantas" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2019333048/1710footerQantasOneworldLogo.jpg" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F6670"></font></a></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F6B10"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F6D70" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F7230"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F7490" style="font-family: Arial, Ciutadella; font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 9px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F7870" style="font-weight: bold;">Qantas Privacy Notice</span><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F7AD0"><span data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F7D10">Qantas collects information about you (including health information where necessary) to provide products and services to you, process your travel arrangements, facilitate your participation in the loyalty programs of Qantas and other organisations, conduct marketing activities and market research. If the information is not provided Qantas may not be able to provide the service requested. Qantas may disclose your personal information to its related companies, other carriers, travel service providers, organisations which provide services to Qantas, third parties acting on Qantas' behalf, various law enforcement agencies and governments around the world for security, customs and immigration purposes. Further details can be found in our Privacy Statement on qantas.com. You can gain access to the information Qantas holds about you by contacting Qantas Corporate Sales on 13 10 85.</span></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F9600"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F9970" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0FB220" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0FB480"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0FB6E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0FB940" style="font-size: 10px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0FBBA0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0FBE00" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0FC790"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0FCB20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 15px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, 